{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_16", "source_id": "6788ff6c00000000180308ff", "title": "一张常年用酸的脸", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6788ff6c00000000180308ff", "topic_family": "刷酸与焕肤", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1218, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["用酸5年，酸是我最爱的一个护肤品，让我从满脸痘痘闭口到现在皮肤细腻光滑", "这个是哪怕现在的我已经能用很高浓度的酸，但每次用它还是觉得很不错", "如果是城墙皮或者对酸有耐受度，一定要试试", "ACID TRIO MASKS 毕生之研", "STEP3 MMARINI SKIN RESEARCH", "每次用的时候，先用些修护精华在脸上涂一遍，当做打底，再用1、2滴这个涂角质层厚的区域，最后用个修护面霜封层就好，我这么用从来没有翻车过✌️", "大家搓过澡吗 搓过澡的皮肤很滑很嫩 酸就相当于是给脸搓澡，把老废角质弄掉，我不用酸的时候脸上角质层巨厚，三天两头闷闭口，用再好的粉底液妆感都很粗糙，没办法因为底子糙"], "retained_quotes": ["每次用的时候，先用些修护精华在脸上涂一遍，当做打底，再用1、2滴这个涂角质层厚的区域，最后用个修护面霜封层就好，我这么用从来没有翻车过✌️", "大家搓过澡吗 搓过澡的皮肤很滑很嫩 酸就相当于是给脸搓澡，把老废角质弄掉，我不用酸的时候脸上角质层巨厚，三天两头闷闭口，用再好的粉底液妆感都很粗糙，没办法因为底子糙"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6788ff6c00000000180308ff/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6788ff6c00000000180308ff/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6788ff6c00000000180308ff/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6788ff6c00000000180308ff/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "44fd40a636014ed13acffb716eedf8e9bbf407acf344a63afbd42f7dd38a20de", "card_hash": "ba51ec732f8852d6a15fbec61229717d164cc