{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_16", "source_id": "67808d5d000000002001f906", "title": "冬天到了油皮皮肤最好的时候，护肤搭配献上！", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67808d5d000000002001f906", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1647, "evidence_unit_count": 53, "original_evidence_unit_count": 53, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["冬天是我这个油痘肌一年四季里皮肤最好的季节，天气干燥，我没那么容易出油了，所以可以把控油暂时放一放，把提升肤质、美b、k老给提上来", "和别的酸类精华不同的是，里面还放了些许壬二酸，所以对改善痘印也有些帮助", "Serum Correcteur Taches", "Soin Reparateur Intensif", "RERILLABLE 20ml/0.67fl.oz", "冬天是我这个油痘肌一年四季里皮肤最好的季节，天气干燥，我没那么容易出油了，所以可以把控油暂时放一放，把提升肤质、美b、k老给提上来", "先用酸冻膜，打开皮肤通道，剥脱老废角质 再用两三滴油橄榄全脸涂"], "retained_quotes": ["冬天是我这个油痘肌一年四季里皮肤最好的季节，天气干燥，我没那么容易出油了，所以可以把控油暂时放一放，把提升肤质、美b、k老给提上来", "先用酸冻膜，打开皮肤通道，剥脱老废角质 再用两三滴油橄榄全脸涂"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67808d5d000000002001f906/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67808d5d000000002001f906/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67808d5d000000002001f906/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67808d5d000000002001f906/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b5a063a2754561cc4d86ea9e508bcf0a164008cb72c12cb48e541f885fd40d37", "card_hash": "ddbdb953a88bbaf350752084b3e977ce57250d96684f171702cee517023a8bfe", "callable": false, "status":