{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_16", "source_id": "6777b5d1000000001300319a", "title": "超解压晚间护肤~20分钟养成水煮蛋", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6777b5d1000000001300319a", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1419, "evidence_unit_count": 41, "original_evidence_unit_count": 41, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 115, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["哈嘍 我是小森林 歡迎來到我的晚間護膚 最近一月發生一些事情", "你們一定要把精華油用起來 我最近很喜歡這個機率的稅前能量油", "真的是會加速我們皮膚衰老的 那它就相當於給我們的皮膚細胞", "有的時候會聽一些清音樂 然後配合覺得打坐 我覺得這樣子對於我們清空身體的效果非常好", "都是開心快樂的 保持一個好的狀態 那好了 我再同一個神不精華 就要去睡覺囉 晚安", "然後給你們推薦一下我的妙用 就是用完了這個油之後呢 再來敷一片他們家最近很火的這個", "是不是非常簡單 但是該有的我們都有了 如果大家最近跟我一樣"], "retained_quotes": ["然後給你們推薦一下我的妙用 就是用完了這個油之後呢 再來敷一片他們家最近很火的這個", "是不是非常簡單 但是該有的我們都有了 如果大家最近跟我一樣"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6777b5d1000000001300319a/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6777b5d1000000001300319a/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6777b5d1000000001300319a/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6777b5d1000000001300319a/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "a5240a61f36745b4f0f5abc46b92b714bdc84327ea031a5c544409427043165f", "card_hash": "13c45b2de496cc075017c153a7b9d26644dc2d0fca2e7563804f6d1700914029", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_16", "source_id": "67763f4a000000000902dfac", "title": "本油皮超爱的秋冬防晒，巴不得365天每天用！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67763f4a000000000902dfac", "topic_family": "防晒", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1145, "evidence_unit_count": 34, "original_evidence_unit_count": 34, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 98, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["就比我手裏頭所有的貴婦底妝粉質都要細膩 它會讓你的底妝更加的服貼", "它也是隔離防曬 我剛剛去翻了一下記錄 我是從20年就開始用它的", "你塗兩三層都不會厚重 但是你塗兩三層 你臉上那個防曬力有什麼夠的", "會更加的貼臉 防曬系數也很高 是SPF50加PA4個加 這樣冬天你們要去公園的話也很適合", "好了這三支這是我 特別喜歡在秋冬天用的防曬和有色面霜 你們如果有什麼好忘的 也歡迎在評論區分享給我", "那先說一下 我是那種特別容易因為防曬而溫鬥的服製 所以我喜歡的防曬", "我之前試過就是同一款粉底 如果我妝前還是用的它的話 那我的那款粉底那一天的表現都非常好"], "retained_quotes": ["那先說一下 我是那種特別容易因為防曬而溫鬥的服製 所以我喜歡的防曬", "我之前試過就是同一款粉底 如果我妝前還是用的它的話 那我的那款粉底那一天的表現都非常好"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67763f4a000000000902dfac/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67763f4a000000000902dfac/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67763f4a000000000902dfac/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67763f4a000000000902dfac/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "875499f719cca20a8f8ac39c4a67fd2f94fd7c43c6d30ab536fc5d0a8721e979", "card_hash": "49f242cbba90914b10324e9f92b3d0838f3660ab3b725fd02f5b53e9b4f2fdf2", "callable": false, "status": "candidate